<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Farba</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as farbas</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">A farba was a provincial governor in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mali-empire">Mali Empire</a>. Farbas exercised authority delegated by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mansa">mansa</a> over provinces and subject areas, balancing imperial oversight with a large degree of local autonomy alongside village chiefs.</p></div>
